/* 0.3.0 – host key verification */
"Could not read the host keys of %@." = "Nije moguće pročitati ključeve servera %@.";
"The server's identity has not been confirmed yet." = "Identitet servera još nije potvrđen.";
"Confirm the server's identity" = "Potvrdi identitet servera";
"This is the first connection to this server. To be sure you are talking to the real server and not an impostor, compare the fingerprint below with the one your provider publishes. They must match exactly." = "Ovo je prvo spajanje na ovaj server. Da budeš siguran da je to pravi server, a ne netko tko se lažno predstavlja, usporedi otisak ispod s onim koji objavljuje tvoj pružatelj usluge. Moraju biti potpuno jednaki.";
"Hetzner publishes the fingerprints of its Storage Boxes in the Storage Box documentation." = "Hetzner objavljuje otiske svojih Storage Boxova u dokumentaciji za Storage Box.";
"Only continue if the fingerprints match. The server is remembered in ~/.ssh/known_hosts, and every later connection is checked against it." = "Nastavi samo ako se otisci podudaraju. Server se pamti u ~/.ssh/known_hosts i svako se sljedeće spajanje provjerava prema tome.";
"Trust This Server" = "Vjeruj ovom serveru";
"This server hasn't been verified yet" = "Ovaj server još nije provjeren";
"Before the first connection, confirm the server's fingerprint so nobody can impersonate it." = "Prije prvog spajanja potvrdi otisak servera, da se nitko ne može lažno predstaviti kao on.";
"Verify Server…" = "Provjeri server…";
"The server's identity has changed" = "Identitet servera se promijenio";
"The server presents a different key than the one you trusted. This can mean someone is intercepting the connection. If your provider announced new keys, remove the old entry for this server from ~/.ssh/known_hosts and connect again." = "Server pokazuje drugi ključ od onog kojem si vjerovao. To može značiti da netko presreće vezu. Ako je pružatelj usluge najavio nove ključeve, ukloni stari unos za ovaj server iz ~/.ssh/known_hosts i spoji se ponovno.";

