"On the first backup, everything in it that isn't in your local folder is moved to the versions folder – nothing is deleted, but the folder will then match your Mac exactly." = "Pri prvom backupu sve što nije u tvom lokalnom folderu seli se u folder verzija – ništa se ne briše, ali će folder nakon toga biti točna kopija tvog Maca.";
"I understand, use this folder" = "Razumijem, koristi ovaj folder";
