"The backup runs in the background at this time. If the Mac is asleep or off, it runs as soon as it wakes up." = "Backup se pokreće u pozadini u to vrijeme. Ako Mac spava ili je ugašen, pokreće se čim se probudi.";
"Full Disk Access needed" = "Potreban je Full Disk Access";
"Scheduled backups can't read Desktop, Documents or Downloads until StorageBox Sync is allowed in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Full Disk Access." = "Zakazani backup ne može čitati Desktop, Documents ni Downloads dok StorageBox Sync ne dobije dozvolu u System Settings → Privacy & Security → Full Disk Access.";
"You're all set" = "Sve je spremno";
"We recommend a preview first: it lists what the first backup would upload, without changing anything." = "Preporučujemo prvo pregled promjena: pokazuje što bi prvi backup uploadao, bez ikakvih izmjena.";
